			<_name type="a">Accuracy</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.7.2025::13:53:44</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">1.7.2025::13:53:44</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The SMSWTD shall ensure that data achieves a minimum accuracy level of 85%25 or within a defined range for each parameter, as per industry standards or sensor specifications.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">152</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
