			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall ensure that data from sources is collected within a maximum delay of 10 seconds to ensure real-time or near-real-time updates.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
